area $A:$\n\n$$\nA≈\\overset{1\\text{st trapezoid}}{\\overset{⏞}{[\\,\\frac{\\overset{\\text{bases}}{\\overset{⏞}{f(-3)+f(-1)}}}{2}\\,\\cdot \\,{{Δ{x}_{1}}_{⏟}}_{\\text{height}}\\,]}}+\\overset{2\\text{nd trapezoid}}{\\overset{⏞}{[\\,\\frac{\\overset{\\text{bases}}{\\overset{⏞}{f(-1)+f(0)}}}{2}\\,\\cdot \\,{{Δ{x}_{2}}_{⏟}}_{\\text{height}}\\,]}}+\\overset{3\\text{rd trapezoid}}{\\overset{⏞}{[\\,\\frac{\\overset{\\text{bases}}{\\overset{⏞}{f(0)+f(2)}}}{2}\\,\\cdot \\,{{Δ{x}_{3}}_{⏟}}_{\\text{height}}\\,]}}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the appropriate numbers into the above expression gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & ≈\\frac{2+4}{2}\\cdot (-1-(-3))+\\frac{4+8}{2}\\cdot (0-(-1))+\\frac{8+6}{2}\\cdot (2-0) \\\\  & =3\\cdot 2+6\\cdot 1+7\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =6+6+14 \\\\  & =26\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14055663/state.json" "file_sha256" "cf1634a225c4c3e644f2084ccc5912363b741709dfc78e7b57d5b6634b41c2d9"} {"question" "q-116300" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14055663/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "4b62787f769c79c89ecea6de9ba458f172c4ff5cad3ecb64410e86ddb5e889cb"} {"question" "q-116300" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14055663/state.json" "file_sha256" "cf1634a225c4c3e644f2084ccc5912363b741709dfc78e7b57d5b6634b41c2d9"} {"question" "q-116300" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "13"] ["math" "17"] ["math" "26"] ["math" "34"] ["math" "52"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14055663/state.json" "file_sha256" "cf1634a225c4c3e644f2084ccc5912363b741709d